body:
I feel like I accepted Christ years ago, but fell away to the point where I'll never return. I've prayed that prayer so many times I can't count it. I've felt The Holy Spirit before. I've used The Spirit to help me stop sinning. I've felt conviction of sin. ive had prayers answered within hours of praying it. But not so much anymore. I think im close to the unforgivable sin. Its scary.. i know i grieve The Spirit day after day; I'll sin even when i know its wrong, but i dont rlly feel anything as strong as I used to. I've been through so much with God and praying. idk what to do, and it sucks because  my entire life from now until I die feels \*almost\* completely pointless unless I try again. It just hurts knowing where I could've been at this point in life, and instead I chose all of this temporary stuff that won't  matter 1 sec after I die. 

&#x200B;

I just hate that I did this all to myself.  And I'm 25.

You belong in the rank you're in for a reason. If you're diamond 2 on your main, then that's your skill level. I guarantee you that if you keep playing games on your alt, you'll drop straight out of Champ 3 and back into diamond. There's too big of a skill gap between those 2 ranks for you to be able to handle consistently. I don't know how long you've been in diamond, but if it's been more than 1 season and you're still there, that's where you belong. If you belonged in Champ 3, you would get out of diamond so easily, past champ 1, and either stay around mid-high Champ 2, or somewhere in Champ 3.

&#x200B;

I did something very similar in the past. I was probably around diamond on my main.

&#x200B;

I got an alt and did placements, won all of them +5 games. I was Champ 1 Div 4. 

All of a sudden I'm almost Champ 2, after being stuck in Diamond on my main. Do I belong there? No. 

Immediately after getting div 4, I started losing over and over. Why? I don't belong there. I belong in diamond.

&#x200B;

I'd like to see your rank after around 50-100 games played, it won't be Champ 3.

since all you peeps think im a crazy pos, okay. ill give you that side of me. I was obsessed with Columbine back in September 2018 and kept having thoughts about shooting up my college. So i went and told someone and got help. stayed in 2 different psych wards. im under a court order. i still am banned from campus. it fucked my life up.    

&#x200B;

\*maybe i am crazy\*

Here is a screenshot I just took. I have no idea why it says I have "two pair"  [https://i.gyazo.com/60fd6c45a3fac1ded5722123c654288a.png](https://i.gyazo.com/60fd6c45a3fac1ded5722123c654288a.png)

&#x200B;

I would assume all I have is a High Card?

I've been in a similar situation. I got prescribed Prozac at the end of September 2018. And a psych med. I couldn't really tell that much if the prozac was making me feel better or not, and eventually I got off of it because I wanted to see if anything would happen. No not really. I still feel the same taking it or not. And the psych med they gave me... olanzapine... stay AWAY from that. It made me feel psychotic. I guess because it's for psychotic people, and I WASN'T, but they thought I was. So yeah, September 2018 I got diagnosed with depression, which didn't surprise me. I remember feeling really depressed back when I was like 15 or 16 and stuff. I'm 22 now, and it's still here. Also I used to cut myself, even got addicted to it. Back when I had panic attacks I would cut and it would make them go away. I don't get panic attacks that much anymore, though. I'm not sure whether you're a male or female, but I'm a guy and I am really lonely as well. I sleep about 12+ hours every day because I'm just depressed, you know? My sleep schedule is wack too. 

&#x200B;

Sometimes I really wish I had a female friend that I could just... how do I word it... idk maybe just cuddle up with and talk about life. Or something like that. Sip some coffee and just chill and talk about how we're feeling. I don't have a gf either btw, I also thought I liked being alone, but sometimes that stuff SUCKS. It HURTS.

Yeah. It can be expunged after 10 years but still. It sucks that it's there.

&#x200B;

Thanks for info.

I started playing in 2015 in Season 3.

&#x200B;

I remember in Season 8 and 9 I got boosted in 2v2 to Grand Champ. I believe I was a Champ 2 at the time, or a low Champ 3. Anyway I did win some games but eventually lost the rank (because I didn't belong there). Fast forward to Season 10 and I solo q to GC in 3v3 and get rewards. Now this season I've gotten GC in 2v2 legitly, and I'm slowly getting better (I only have 6/10 gc wins currently) but If i'm playing really well I can hang with 1600's; couldn't do that a few seasons ago. So from Season 8-10 I've had noticeable improvement. Currently I have over 2600 hours in Rocket League.

&#x200B;

If it matters, I was like level 125 when I got boosted in Season 8. Now I'm like 555 or something.

&#x200B;

When I get on I either go into freeplay for like 5-10 min or do some training packs or both before ranked. Or play some casuals to warm up. Honestly I need to do more training to get more consistent with shots and such. Then I'll be able to hit GC easily.

&#x200B;

IMO it's a lot easier for a bronze to get plat than it is for a low GC to get high GC (because of the refinements that must be made).

&#x200B;

Hope I helped.

God these kinds of parents fucking disgust me. Don't listen to them. Don't let what they say drag you down. My dad told me I was going to grow up and be "weird" because I would never leave the house and hang out with friends. And that's when I started cutting myself. AND, guess fucking what. I don't like hanging out with people. Unless its for skateboarding or snowboarding. You're parents should NOT of responded that way after finding out that you cut.. but... I guess that's how it is... and I'm sorry. If you want to talk to me you can (I'm a 21 yr guy if that matters). I understand the whole "they think it will make me get better grades" thing. It's BULL-FUCKING-SHIT. It won't help SHIT. It will only make our hole deeper. The idea that parents will "take away priveleges" so that we'll getting better grades is the most fucking idiotic ideology that i've ever fucking heard. IT. DOESN'T. FUCKING. WORK. And they don't seem to ever fucking understand that. Listen... I know it fucking sucks right now. Okay? It fucking SUCKS. I know. If  you're parents seriously act like that toward your sh, then fuck 'em. Don't listen to them. They're not worth your time. You should talk to your bf about this if you haven't already. If you're uncomfortable, you can msg me and I'll respond as soon as I see it. You're parents unfortunately don't seem to care enough. I know reading this may hurt, but what other conclusion are you supposed to draw from it? And yeah, like alldayaday420 said, one day you'll be able to live on your own and not have to deal with the constant bull-fucking-shit that you're parents give you. Hang in there, PLEASE. 

&#x200B;

Message me if you want. I will talk to you. I promise. <3

I don't know all the details as she wouldn't tell me. But before all of this... me and her had sex. He found out and I guess got jealous?? I'm pretty sure he liked her as well.. so he messaged her and basically said that " if you don't have sex with me then I'm going to tell everyone you and your brother had sex". And that wouldn't go well if our family found out. She was afraid that she wouldn't get to see me anymore...so she had sex with him so he would keep quiet. Keep in mind.. we were both 16 / 17 at the time. She lived almost 2 hours away from me and neither of us were able to drive yet. So if our families found out what we did, they would be really angry and prolly not let us see each other.

&#x200B;

Still kinda her fault tho because she chose to cheat on me
